  (
    "fixture qug",
    "\u{a}        Kawsaypi yuyashpa, kishpiriy, paktakay, allpapachapi kasikllakawsay tiksi\u{a}        kakpimi tukuy runakuna sumak kawsayta charichun nishpa riksin; shinallatak\u{a}        sumaykayta(dignidad), paktapakta hayñita ayllumanta mana pi kichuchunmi\u{a}        riksin.\u{a}       \u{a}        Kawsaypi yuyashpa, piñashpa mana riksina, runakunapak hayñita saruy,\u{a}        runapura wañunakuna yuyaymi tukuysami kawsaypi sapiyashka nin.\u{a}        Chaymi tukuysami lIakikunata IIaktakunaman apamushka. Chaymantami\u{a}        runakunaka tukuy IIaktakunapi kaparishpa kishpirishka kawsayta yuyashpa\u{a}        mashkay kallarin; wakcha runakuna, IIakta runakuna, upallalla kawsak\u{a}        runakuna, shitashka runakuna kishpirinata munan. Mashná kay pachapi\u{a}        kawsakkunami kay amsa, ñawsa, milli kawsaymanta lIukshinata munan. Kipaka\u{a}        kishpiy rimayta, yuyayta charina kan.\u{a}       \u{a}        Kawsaypi yuyashpa, runakunapak hayñitaka, paypak hayñimi nishpa shuktak\u{a}        kamachi lIikakuna kamashka kachun. Shina waKcha run",
